@startuml
title Final Group Project: Hybrid RAG + General LLM Architecture
caption FastAPI backend routes each query to grounded RAG or general LLM based on retrieval relevance.

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

actor User

rectangle "React Frontend (Vite)\nChat UI + include_english toggle" as FE #D8EBFF
rectangle "FastAPI Controller\nPOST /api/translate" as API #E2E8F0

package "Main Request Flow" #EEF2FF {
  rectangle "RuleBasedService\n(deterministic intents)" as RULE #DCFCE7
  rectangle "CorpusRepository\nretrieve_context(k=4)" as REPO #FEE2E2
  rectangle "Relevance Gate\n_is_rag_relevant()" as GATE #FFEDD5

  together {
    rectangle "RAG Prompt Path\n(use retrieved context only)" as RAG #E0F2FE
    rectangle "General LLM Path\n(no RAG restriction)" as GEN #FEF3C7
  }

  rectangle "LLMService\nAzure OpenAI chat_completion" as LLM #F3E8FF
  rectangle "TranslationService\nEnglish -> Spanish" as TR #FCE7F3
  rectangle "API Response\n{ spanish, english(optional) }" as RESP #DCFCE7
}

package "Retrieval Side Flow (Knowledge Base)" #F1F5F9 {
  rectangle "Auto refresh on file changes" as REFRESH
  rectangle "KB Documents\n.docx, .txt, .md, .json, .csv" as KB
  rectangle "Chunking + normalization\n+ source metadata" as CHUNK
  rectangle "Retriever\nSentenceTransformer (preferred)\nor TF-IDF fallback" as RET
}

User --> FE
FE --> API
API --> RULE
RULE --> REPO
REPO --> GATE

GATE --> RAG : relevant context
GATE --> GEN : low/no relevance

RAG --> LLM
GEN --> LLM

RAG ..> REPO : extractive fallback (RAG-relevant only)

LLM --> TR
TR --> RESP
RESP --> API
API --> FE

KB --> CHUNK
CHUNK --> RET
REFRESH --> REPO
RET --> REPO : top-k chunks + scores

note right of GATE
Routing policy:
- If top retrieved context is relevant: use RAG prompt path
- Else: use general LLM prompt path
end note

note bottom of KB
Default KB includes project proposal and design report documents.
end note

@enduml
